      en: ["Major 19th-century inland port for the palm oil and timber trade.", "Located on the lower Rokel River, Sierra Leone's longest river system.", "A key site for political negotiations between Temne chiefs and the British.", "Once a primary gathering point for mahogany exports to Europe.", "Played a strategic role during the Hut Tax War of 1898.", "Famed for the colonial-era stone architecture of its riverfront warehouses."],
      es: ["Ubicación: 40 km al este de Freetown.", "Activo en el comercio de esclavos hasta 1807.", "Después, comercio de aceite de palma y marfil.", "Hallazgos arqueológicos: cuentas de vidrio, cerámica.", "Hoy en día, un pueblo de pescadores.", "Patrimonio cultural protegido."],
      pt: ["Localização: 40 km a leste de Freetown.", "Ativo no comércio de escravos até 1807.", "Depois, comércio de óleo de palma e marfim.", "Descobertas arqueológicas: contas de vidro, cerâmica.", "Hoje em dia, uma aldeia de pescadores.", "Património cultural protegido."],
      fr: ["Lieu : 40 km à l'est de Freetown.", "Actif dans la traite des esclaves jusqu'en 1807.", "Ensuite, commerce de l'huile de palme et de l'ivoire.", "Découvertes archéologiques : perles de verre, céramique.", "Aujourd'hui, un village de pêcheurs.", "Patrimoine culturel protégé."],
